1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,729 --> 00:00:11,370
Last time, we listened for
higher, lower, or the same.

3
00:00:13,770 --> 00:00:17,832
Today we are going to feel the beat.

4
00:00:19,832 --> 00:00:25,704
Music has a beat. It keeps
going, like your heartbeat.

5
00:00:26,104 --> 00:00:30,259
Put your hand on your
chest. Can you feel it?

6
00:00:34,159 --> 00:00:39,428
A steady beat never
rushes, and never stops.

7
00:00:41,528 --> 00:00:43,546
Let's count the beat.

8
00:00:44,758 --> 00:00:45,390
One.

9
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:46,117
Two.

10
00:00:46,167 --> 00:00:46,897
Three.

11
00:00:46,947 --> 00:00:47,708
Four.

12
00:00:47,758 --> 00:00:48,390
One.

13
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:49,117
Two.

14
00:00:49,167 --> 00:00:49,897
Three.

15
00:00:49,947 --> 00:00:51,147
Four.

16
00:00:52,790 --> 00:00:54,716
Now march with me!

17
00:00:56,008 --> 00:00:56,640
One.

18
00:00:56,690 --> 00:00:57,367
Two.

19
00:00:57,417 --> 00:00:58,147
Three.

20
00:00:58,197 --> 00:00:58,958
Four.

21
00:00:59,008 --> 00:00:59,640
One.

22
00:00:59,690 --> 00:01:00,367
Two.

23
00:01:00,417 --> 00:01:01,147
Three.

24
00:01:01,197 --> 00:01:02,397
Four.

25
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:06,430
Now clap on every beat!

26
00:01:07,258 --> 00:01:07,890
One.

27
00:01:07,940 --> 00:01:08,617
Two.

28
00:01:08,667 --> 00:01:09,397
Three.

29
00:01:09,447 --> 00:01:10,208
Four.

30
00:01:10,258 --> 00:01:10,890
One.

31
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:11,617
Two.

32
00:01:11,667 --> 00:01:12,397
Three.

33
00:01:12,447 --> 00:01:13,647
Four.

34
00:01:15,290 --> 00:01:17,401
A beat can be fast,

35
00:01:19,701 --> 00:01:21,116
or slow.

36
00:01:25,016 --> 00:01:27,499
But it always stays steady.

37
00:01:31,099 --> 00:01:34,231
Your turn! Is this beat steady?

38
00:01:43,631 --> 00:01:45,696
Yes! Steady.

39
00:01:58,196 --> 00:02:00,539
No! It wobbled.

40
00:02:12,939 --> 00:02:15,004
Yes! Steady.

41
00:02:15,504 --> 00:02:16,826
You've got it!

42
00:02:18,526 --> 00:02:19,987
Now it's your turn!

43
00:02:20,087 --> 00:02:24,288
Play Beat Tapper, and
tap along with the drum!

44
00:02:24,388 --> 00:02:26,778
See you for the next Nugget!

